WEBVTT

00:00:00.570 --> 00:00:04.540
All right, everybody!
Kaleido Star is going to start!

00:00:04.540 --> 00:00:07.440
When you watch Kaleido Star,
please keep your room brightly lit,

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:09.430
and sit as far from the TV as you can.

00:00:11.680 --> 00:00:14.280
Well, well, well. Rosetta here!

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:16.690
Did everyone watch my trapeze act?

00:00:16.690 --> 00:00:19.760
I was so happy to perform with Sora,
the person I admire.

00:00:19.760 --> 00:00:24.160
I'm going to do intense training like Sora did,
and become even better!

00:00:24.230 --> 00:00:26.960
I'm giving the trapeze another try
during my next circus tour,

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:28.960
but I've met a certain person there.

00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:30.470
That person is...

00:00:30.470 --> 00:00:36.270
Okay, let's make a great show together
again today! Let's! Let's!

00:00:40.480 --> 00:00:47.820
<i>Tattoo Kiss, the beginning is
red and black passions</i>

00:00:40.480 --> 00:00:47.820
<i>Tattoo Kiss hajimari wa aka to kuro no Passion</i>

00:00:47.820 --> 00:00:55.120
<i>Sometimes, we rely on our contrary hearts</i>

00:00:47.820 --> 00:00:55.120
