<i>Harbor light (Stormy night)</i>

00:22:55.710 --> 00:22:57.610
<i>Harbor light (stormy night)</i>

00:22:57.610 --> 00:23:01.410
<i>Escape for the sake of tomorrow</i>

00:22:57.610 --> 00:23:01.410
<i>Asuno tame ni escape</i>

00:23:02.320 --> 00:23:08.090
<i>Even I don't have a vacation,
I've got an oasis</i>

00:23:02.320 --> 00:23:08.090
<i>Bakansu nashi demo oashisu wa get</i>

00:23:08.090 --> 00:23:14.520
<i>I'll turn off the cell phone
and charge my love</i>

00:23:08.090 --> 00:23:14.520
<i>Keitai off tte ai o charge shite</i>

00:23:15.130 --> 00:23:19.370
<i>Because some pain,
you can't soothe with just kindness</i>

00:23:15.130 --> 00:23:19.370
<i>Yasashisa dake ja iyasenai itami mo aru kara</i>

00:23:19.370 --> 00:23:23.230
<i>We are alone. We pass each other</i>

00:23:19.370 --> 00:23:23.230
<i>We are alone. Surechigau</i>

00:23:23.670 --> 00:23:24.640
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:23:23.670 --> 00:23:24.640
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:23:24.870 --> 00:23:29.900
<i>At the far end of regret,
I encounter my true heart</i>

00:23:24.870 --> 00:23:29.900
<i>Koukai no hate ni deau true heart</i>

00:23:30.540 --> 00:23:37.280
<i>Whether I'm crying or laughing,
I will be with you</i>

00:23:30.540 --> 00:23:37.280
<i>Naite mo waratte mo I'll be with U</i>

00:23:40.520 --> 00:23:42.720
Next Kaleido Star: New Wings

00:23:43.320 --> 00:23:46.290
I thought I'd give you a chance
to take your revenge.

00:23:46.290 --> 00:23:49.300
And so, the Kaleido Stage is reopening!

00:23:49.300 --> 00:23:50.700
But...

00:23:50.700 --> 00:23:54.540
The truth about what happened between Leon
and Yuri three years ago will finally be revealed.

00:23:54.540 --> 00:23:57.600
The cruel demon who slashed an angel's
innocence to pieces.

00:23:57.600 --> 00:23:59.730
Both of you, stop it!

